{"step": 1, "before": "id:180", "after": "id:180", "before_label": "West House", "after_label": "West House", "action": "open mailbox", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 0, "delta": 0, "result": "Opening the small mailbox reveals a leaflet.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 2, "before": "id:180", "after": "id:78", "before_label": "West House", "after_label": "Forest", "action": "west", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 0, "delta": 0, "result": "Forest\nThis is a forest, with trees in all directions. To the east, there appears to be sunlight.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 3, "before": "id:78", "after": "id:75", "before_label": "Forest (room #78)", "after_label": "Forest Path", "action": "east", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 0, "delta": 0, "result": "Forest Path\nThis is a path winding through a dimly lit forest. The path heads north-south here. One particularly large tree with some low branches stands at the edge of the path.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 4, "before": "id:75", "after": "id:74", "before_label": "Forest Path", "after_label": "Clearing", "action": "go around forest", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 0, "delta": 0, "result": "Clearing\nYou are in a small clearing in a well marked forest path that extends to the east and west.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 5, "before": "id:74", "after": "id:79", "before_label": "Clearing (room #74)", "after_label": "Behind House", "action": "west", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 0, "delta": 0, "result": "Behind House\nYou are behind the white house. A path leads into the forest to the east. In one corner of the house there is a small window which is slightly ajar.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 6, "before": "id:79", "after": "id:79", "before_label": "Behind House", "after_label": "Behind House", "action": "open window", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 0, "delta": 0, "result": "With great effort, you open the window far enough to allow entry.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 7, "before": "id:79", "after": "id:203", "before_label": "Behind House", "after_label": "Kitchen", "action": "west", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 10, "delta": 10, "result": "Kitchen\nYou are in the kitchen of the white house. A table seems to have been used recently for the preparation of food. A passage leads to the west and a dark staircase can be seen leading upward. A dark chimney leads down and to the east is a small window which is open.\nOn the table is an elongated brown sack, smelling of hot peppers.\nA bottle is sitting on the table.\nThe glass bottle contains:\n  A quantity of water\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 8, "before": "id:203", "after": "id:193", "before_label": "Kitchen", "after_label": "Living Room", "action": "west", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 10, "delta": 0, "result": "Living Room\nYou are in the living room. There is a doorway to the east, a wooden door with strange gothic lettering to the west, which appears to be nailed shut, a trophy case, and a large oriental rug in the center of the room.\nAbove the trophy case hangs an elvish sword of great antiquity.\nA battery-powered brass lantern is on the trophy case.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 9, "before": "id:193", "after": "id:193", "before_label": "Living Room", "after_label": "Living Room", "action": "take lantern", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 10, "delta": 0, "result": "Taken.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": ["brass lantern"], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 10, "before": "id:193", "after": "id:193", "before_label": "Living Room", "after_label": "Living Room", "action": "push rug", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 10, "delta": 0, "result": "With a great effort, the rug is moved to one side of the room, revealing the dusty cover of a closed trap door.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 11, "before": "id:193", "after": "id:193", "before_label": "Living Room", "after_label": "Living Room", "action": "open trap", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 10, "delta": 0, "result": "The door reluctantly opens to reveal a rickety staircase descending into darkness.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 12, "before": "id:193", "after": "id:72", "before_label": "Living Room", "after_label": "Cellar", "action": "down", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 35, "delta": 25, "result": "You have moved into a dark place.\nThe trap door crashes shut, and you hear someone barring it.\n\nIt is pitch black. You are likely to be eaten by a grue.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 13, "before": "id:72", "after": "id:72", "before_label": "Cellar", "after_label": "Cellar", "action": "turn on lantern", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 35, "delta": 0, "result": "The brass lantern is now on.\n\nCellar\nYou are in a dark and damp cellar with a narrow passageway leading north, and a crawlway to the south. On the west is the bottom of a steep metal ramp which is unclimbable.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 14, "before": "id:72", "after": "id:71", "before_label": "Cellar", "after_label": "East Chasm", "action": "south", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 35, "delta": 0, "result": "East of Chasm\nYou are on the east edge of a chasm, the bottom of which cannot be seen. A narrow passage goes north, and the path you are on continues to the east.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 15, "before": "id:71", "after": "id:148", "before_label": "East Chasm", "after_label": "Gallery", "action": "east", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 35, "delta": 0, "result": "Gallery\nThis is an art gallery. Most of the paintings have been stolen by vandals with exceptional taste. The vandals left through either the north or west exits.\nFortunately, there is still one chance for you to be a vandal, for on the far wall is a painting of unparalleled beauty.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 16, "before": "id:148", "after": "id:148", "before_label": "Gallery", "after_label": "Gallery", "action": "take art", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 39, "delta": 4, "result": "Taken.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": ["painting"], "inventory_removed": []}
